Description: Cinnamon clock with multiple time and calendar systems
 Calendar Plus integrates with Cinnamon's panel, popup, settings and calendar
 service while adding decimal, Internet, Unix, hexadecimal, binary, sidereal,
 solar, Julian Date, mean-solar, Modified Julian, traditional Chinese, Roman
 temporal and Edo Japanese clock modes plus 22 civil, religious, historical
 and experimental calendar systems. A platform-neutral C core handles conversion,
 grid construction, event intervals and precise scheduling; thin native and
 JavaScript adapters provide Cinnamon integration. The same amd64 package can
 use the system ICU supplied by Ubuntu/Mint or Debian.
